<description>&lt;p&gt;Chinese coast guard and navy vessels are expanding combat-readiness patrols, water-cannon drills and have moved the carrier Liaoning into the western Pacific, prompting alarms from the Philippines, Taiwan and Japan. The Philippine Coast Guard is delivering fuel to Filipino fishermen at Scarborough Shoal, rescuing a ferry listing off Quezon Province and saving 58 passengers, while also conducting a joint search-and-rescue exercise with the US Coast Guard in the West Philippine Sea. Taiwan reports Chinese coast guard ships harassing shipping and entering Dongsha restricted waters, and Chinese vessels are suspected of surveying undersea cables near Japan and the Philippines. The UCDP recorded 176 battle-related deaths in 2024, according to UCDP.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;em&gt;Machine-written from the linked sources, checked for figures and names not in them.&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMidEFVX3lxTE1NMy1kZE0tQkNwRDNGaVVGanljUDRDd2s3RlJjd2dZaEJSWXQ3TUgwSFNpc0prVXYySkRTR2tpcndtRGQ5TUkyM2pNMmZxRk1ZZ2FGWkl6aW5YRFlCMmV5QmJzTEdPbi1oZm83M0FBLXU5NTRj?oc=5&quot;&gt;University of the Philippines&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Breitbart News&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.?oc=5&quot;&gt;Plataforma Media&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMirgFBVV95cUxOc1pxSl9oQnI1UWNFbW1aQi1CMXlJMEtHZjRLVzZJSnpLY0I4UFVzWHg3WmpKNVIxanJCWFduekN1UWNMXzM5MHdrcnk3NWQ5VTRHYlY0TVJ5X3ZPMnAyRzF5a3BpOXFLcEZjMjdFRTRyMGN5ZWtnczFDYlNyYlBQLTRFcUE0cUdhVHcxRVhsMFAxejdtNGNFR1ItbXo2dEx3VF9lU1dUdmtnc1pVSUE?oc=5&quot;&gt;Mindanao Times&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href=&quot;https://news.google.com/rss/articles/CBMiowFBVV95cUxORUhFT1ltdmVCMy1Lbk5nb2hVOWRxWHQ2SExtR01UbVMzLWtGQnBWTk9uWkdNWGd5TWxvQnV6QnJkSm5RZGVuYnJxcGh4YWJhLU1kLThGZ0RPNHZWbTg1MlJzdFZEeGkzUTU0QlRVZFBrOFFqQVJhVmE5SEhFbG5zRWFiUE03LXozYjE4Rk5OX3NjQWVmOUk2M29PVjd1Znh3Yi13?oc=5&quot;&gt;Asia News Network&lt;/a&gt;, 